=2 Walkthrough
!Jugner Forest (S) Map.jpg||Map of Jugner Forest (S)
* Speak to {n:Raustigne} in Southern San d'Oria (S) at (I-7/8) for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Elegant Footprints** in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} (I-6) for a cutscene. It is next to the tree stump near the (H-6)/(I-6) center border, just across the makeshift bridge if coming from {z:East Ronfaure (S)}.
** The fastest way to the **Elegant Footprints** is the {p:Survival Guide} in East Ronfaure (S).

* You will be asked to retrieve one of the following items based on questions you are asked in the cutscene.
** The outcome appears to be based on the day the cutscene is started and the answers given, but no pattern has been worked out by players. Note that disconnecting during the cutscene will not change the requested item.
*** If multiple characters begin it on the same day and use the same answers, they will get the same requested item.
*** See {p:Item Request Testimonies|Talk:Dancers in Distress} on the talk page for choices and days.
** {i:Gold Beastcoin|Gold Beastcoin|748}
** {i:Lynx Meat|Lynx Meat|5667}
** {i:Nyumomo Doll|Nyumomo Doll|1706} - Farmed in {z:Batallia Downs} (not {z:Batallia Downs (S)}) from {m:Orcish Beastrider}, {m:Orcish Brawler}, {m:Orcish Impaler}, {m:Orcish Nightraider} with **{p:C|Common (15%)}** droprate. {p:Treasure Hunter} is highly recommended.
* Zone (logging out doesn't count), then trade the item to the **Elegant Footprints** for another cutscene to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To save time on the next mission, kill {m:Wandering Saplings|Wandering Sapling} for a {i:Cernunnos Bulb|Cernunnos Bulb|2728} before leaving {z:Jugner Forest (S)}. Each member completing the missions will need a bulb. Some {m:Wandering Saplings|Wandering Sapling} can be found at (J-6) and (F-10).

